    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow, feed and care for your colony of mighty ants in a realistic semi-idle simulation of ant keeping. Created in collaboration with ant keeping enthusiasts, Ant Keeping Simulator will be an accurate experience to ant keepers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed Your Colony</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/d35533a36bb134256ee7e3f1544bf85c.poster.avif?t=1733106231\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/d35533a36bb134256ee7e3f1544bf85c.webm?t=1733106231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/d35533a36bb134256ee7e3f1544bf85c.mp4?t=1733106231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Feed your hungry colony with protein and carb sources to keep them healthy. Mealworms, cricket legs and sugar water are available in the demo with plans for many more food types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic Ant Behavior</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/6d8e4abd772520d341f805c156db4d06.poster.avif?t=1733106231\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/6d8e4abd772520d341f805c156db4d06.webm?t=1733106231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/6d8e4abd772520d341f805c156db4d06.mp4?t=1733106231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Watch your ants move and interact with their environment in a realistic way. I've taken great care in understanding ant behavior and movent to best simulate them in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch Them Grow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/fa7af636ab4543f37fac4a9a301e204b.poster.avif?t=1733106231\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/fa7af636ab4543f37fac4a9a301e204b.webm?t=1733106231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/fa7af636ab4543f37fac4a9a301e204b.mp4?t=1733106231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Watch your colony grow from just a queen to an enormous colony. Starting with just a test tube and one queen, your colony can grow thousands of ants strong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulate thousands of ants </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom ant path finding system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced ant AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your colonies housing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humidity system</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow, feed and care for your colony of mighty ants in a realistic semi-idle simulation of ant keeping. Created in collaboration with ant keeping enthusiasts, Ant Keeping Simulator will be an accurate experience to ant keepers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed Your Colony</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/d35533a36bb134256ee7e3f1544bf85c.poster.avif?t=1733106231\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/d35533a36bb134256ee7e3f1544bf85c.webm?t=1733106231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/d35533a36bb134256ee7e3f1544bf85c.mp4?t=1733106231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Feed your hungry colony with protein and carb sources to keep them healthy. Mealworms, cricket legs and sugar water are available in the demo with plans for many more food types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic Ant Behavior</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/6d8e4abd772520d341f805c156db4d06.poster.avif?t=1733106231\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/6d8e4abd772520d341f805c156db4d06.webm?t=1733106231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/6d8e4abd772520d341f805c156db4d06.mp4?t=1733106231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Watch your ants move and interact with their environment in a realistic way. I've taken great care in understanding ant behavior and movent to best simulate them in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch Them Grow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/fa7af636ab4543f37fac4a9a301e204b.poster.avif?t=1733106231\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/fa7af636ab4543f37fac4a9a301e204b.webm?t=1733106231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827520/extras/fa7af636ab4543f37fac4a9a301e204b.mp4?t=1733106231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Watch your colony grow from just a queen to an enormous colony. Starting with just a test tube and one queen, your colony can grow thousands of ants strong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulate thousands of ants </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom ant path finding system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced ant AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your colonies housing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humidity system</p></li></ul>",
